   "heading": {
    "en": "Exemption"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "2. The following products are exempted from the application of section 13(1) of the Act:\n(a)human blood products and plasma fractions;\n(b)human hormones;\n(c)vaccines and toxoids;\n(d)diagnostic agents derived from human blood."
   }
